And EuroHPC selected Instinct MI430X GPUs plus 6-generation EPYC

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:35.384
for the Lumie AI Supercomputer. Intel, in a late October release, reported by Tech Powerup,

00:03:35.844 --> 00:03:40.424
put Process Design Kit version 0.9 for 14A in customer's hands.

00:03:41.044 --> 00:03:46.524
LipBoo Tan called that kit the holy grail, because a customer can judge the node and start trial

00:03:46.524 --> 00:03:54.044
designs that carry into PDK 1.0, expected in the first quarter of 2027. Pilot runs have already

00:03:54.044 --> 00:03:59.924
