00:04:00.444 --> 00:04:07.844
Versus 18-A, the design target is 15-20% more performance at the same power, or 25-35%

00:04:07.844 --> 00:04:11.604
less power at the same performance, and up to 30% more density.

00:04:12.424 --> 00:04:16.784
TechPowerUp says it is unclear whether that density number is logic or SRAM.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:23.300
