00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:29.540
HPC Wire says the UK's advanced research and invention agency will deploy LUMI's three-dimensional

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:35.600
optical inference technology in ARIA's Scaling inference lab. LUMI's claim is that doing

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:41.400
